voice-to-text (1.0.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Multilingual support (99+ languages)
  * Language selector: English only vs Multilingual
  * Simplified model menu with smart backend selection
  * Auto-.en model selection for English mode
  * Two backends: whisper.cpp and CTranslate2/faster-whisper
  * GPU acceleration support (CUDA)
  * Settings persistence
  * System tray integration
  * Push-to-talk recording with Scroll Lock
  * Recording limit (300 seconds) with notifications

